# Cursor worktree troubleshooting transport

Cursor Desktop, IDE, Web, and CLI troubleshooting surfaces remain separate capability claims. Use only the configured native entry and its receipt for conflict, review-gui, or cleanup actions; unresolved capability stays unresolved.
